        "message": "=Hello {{$('Get Passenger').item.json.full_name}},\n\nThis is a reminder that your flight {{$('Get Flight Details').item.json.flight_number}} from {{$('Get Flight Details').item.json.origin}} to {{$('Get Flight Details').item.json.destination}} is scheduled to depart at {{$('Get Flight Details').item.json.departure_time}}, within the next 24 hours.\n\nPlease complete your check-in and arrive at the airport on time.\n\nThank you.",
